From 51b2c751af4a68d78261e7b63e731672e0b13240 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: vince <vincepaul.liem@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 22:43:51 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(launch): unify public descriptors and owned pipes

Keep native, memory-file, device and pipe handles behind one bounded
public descriptor table with shared open-object lifetime and per-slot
close-on-exec flags. Reserve slots before mutation and restore translated
arguments before resuming the workload.

Add bounded supervisor-owned pipes with atomic writes, partial-copy
accounting, EOF, SIGPIPE and explicit single-task blocking limits.
Retain existing policy, unit checks and native supervision regressions.

Signed-off-by: vince <vincepaul.liem@gmail.com>
