+lower operator limits. Allocation respects that lower soft limit; runtime
+NOFILE-limit changes are currently denied. Reported limits are not inflated to
+accommodate backend handle ranges. Child process creation remains denied.
+Relative directory-fd access, descriptor polling, process inheritance and exec-time close-on-exec remain unfinished.
